{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dangyang-meeting","title":"鲁肃当阳会刘备","order":6540,"accounts":[{"id":"dangyang-meeting-account-1","label":"记载","text":"鲁肃到当阳长坂与刘备相会，传达孙权之意，劝刘备与孙权并力。","evidence":["su-meets"]},{"id":"dangyang-meeting-account-2","label":"记载","text":"《周瑜传》也记刘备与鲁肃遇于当阳，共同商议。","evidence":["meeting-zhou"]},{"id":"xianzhu-e-p027a-account","label":"《江表传》","text":"鲁肃奉孙权命与刘备相结，在当阳劝刘备联吴而不投吴巨，刘备接受。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-p027a-q"]},{"id":"zhouyu-a-p014-judgment","label":"裴松之按","text":"裴松之认为鲁肃先谋连刘拒曹，与蜀书称诸葛亮始说孙权的叙法舛互。","evidence":["zhouyu-q-p014-judgment"]}],"participants":[{"person":"lu-su","role":"传达孙权之意、劝说联合","evidence":["su-meets"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"与鲁肃会商","evidence":["su-meets"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"派遣鲁肃","evidence":["su-meets"]}],"place":{"text":"当阳长坂","evidence":["su-meets"]},"time":{"label":"建安十三年（208）","year":208,"precision":"year","basis":"年次承接本篇建安十三年记事，现代注释释为公元 208 年；此条未记具体月日。","evidence":["year-original","year-modern","zhou-year","zhou-year-modern","su-meets","meeting-zhou"]}}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"lu-su","name":"鲁肃","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"meeting-zhou","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-df9e8a2d1c2855c608f2","quote":"时刘备为曹公所破，欲引南渡江；与鲁肃遇于当阳，遂共图计。因进住夏口，遣诸葛亮诣权。权遂遣瑜及程普等，与备并力逆曹公，遇于赤壁。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"su-meets","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-ecd089e31afbb09dad94","quote":"权即遣肃行。到夏口，闻曹公已向荆州，晨夜兼道。比至南郡，而表子琮已降曹公；备惶遽奔走，欲南渡江。肃径迎之，到当阳长坂〖10〗，与备会。宣腾权旨〖11〗，及陈江东强固，劝备与权并力：备甚欢悦。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-p027a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-2604f77f12fa0a0ec398","layer":"pei","quote":"《江表传》曰：“孙权遣鲁肃，吊刘表二子，并令与备相结。肃未至，而曹公已济汉津；肃故进前，与备相遇于当阳。因宣权旨，论天下事势，致殷勤之意，且问备曰：‘豫州今欲何至？’备曰：‘与苍梧太守吴（臣）〔巨〕有旧，欲往投之。’肃曰：‘孙讨虏，聪明仁惠，敬贤礼士；江表英豪，咸归附之；已据有六郡，兵精粮多，足以立事。今为君计：莫若遣腹心，使自结于东，崇连和之好，共济世业。而云欲投吴（臣）〔巨〕，巨是凡人，偏在远郡；行将为人所并，岂足托乎？’备大喜，","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":133,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-71fe375a47894e50905a","start":3,"end":222,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"year-modern","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","quote":"十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","layer":"modern","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":3,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"year-original","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。","layer":"original","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhou-year","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-3661896c106f1817bf4b","quote":"十三年春〖6〗，权讨江夏，瑜为前部大督〖7〗。其年九月，曹公入荆州，刘琮举众降。","layer":"original","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhou-year-modern","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-63f47c62fde80b3a0132","quote":"十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","layer":"modern","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8f109f42647e5ee8d831","start":3,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-p014-judgment","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-ce708dbc3c8fcdf9b474","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之按：刘备与权并力，共拒中国，皆肃之本谋。又语诸葛亮曰：“我子瑜友也！”则亮已亟闻肃言矣。而《蜀书•亮传》曰：“亮以连横之略说权，权乃大喜。”如似此计，始出于亮。若二国史官，各记所闻，竟欲称扬本国容美，各取其功；今此二书，同出一人，而舛互若此，非载述之体也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-44a03e4ab7c323e722bd","start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
